WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.038 --> 00:00:02.694
The old woman walked toward Roxy.

2
00:00:02.695 --> 00:00:05.732
"Who are you?" Roxy asked, looking around.

3
00:00:05.733 --> 00:00:07.950
"And where did you come from?"

4
00:00:07.951 --> 00:00:11.587
"I'm the mountain's spirit," the woman said.

5
00:00:11.588 --> 00:00:15.626
"You're a spirit?" Roxy asked, lifting an eyebrow.

6
00:00:15.627 --> 00:00:23.251
"I used to control everything that happens on this mountain," the woman said, nodding.

7
00:00:23.252 --> 00:00:28.918
"It was called Birdsong Mountain, and it was a beautiful place.

8
00:00:28.919 --> 00:00:32.710
Flowers and wildlife filled its slopes.

9
00:00:32.711 --> 00:00:40.486
There were villages, where people raised families and traded goods."

10
00:00:40.487 --> 00:00:43.043
"What happened?" Roxy asked.

11
00:00:43.044 --> 00:00:51.688
"Several years ago a violent storm formed over the mountain," the spirit said sadly.

12
00:00:51.689 --> 00:00:57.157
"Powerful winds blew down trees and houses.

13
00:00:57.158 --> 00:01:01.620
Rain poured down for weeks, causing floods.

14
00:01:01.621 --> 00:01:07.320
The terrible storm was caused by the Demon of Black Rain.

15
00:01:07.321 --> 00:01:12.935
With the help of his demon army, he took over the mountain.

16
00:01:12.936 --> 00:01:18.871
He stole it from me! The villagers and wildlife fled.

17
00:01:18.872 --> 00:01:24.954
Birdsong Mountain has been a dangerous place ever since."

18
00:01:24.955 --> 00:01:27.443
"That's awful!" Roxy said.

19
00:01:27.444 --> 00:01:32.776
"But I'm not scared of that demon. I'll go up there and get rid of him for you."

20
00:01:32.777 --> 00:01:41.559
"No!" the spirit said. "The Demon of Black Rain is too powerful—and dangerous."

21
00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:44.132
"But I have to go," Roxy said.

22
00:01:44.133 --> 00:01:48.690
"The demon has prisoners, and he's going to eat one of them!"

23
00:01:48.691 --> 00:01:56.605
"Yes, sometimes demons capture and eat people," the spirit said with a sigh.

24
00:01:56.606 --> 00:02:02.146
"Perhaps the victim is a poor farmer or even a rich king.

25
00:02:02.147 --> 00:02:05.292
But there's nothing we can do."

26
00:02:05.293 --> 00:02:06.844
Roxy shook her head.

27
00:02:06.845 --> 00:02:09.959
"This prisoner isn't a farmer or a king.

28
00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:12.624
He's someone called the Tang Monk."

29
00:02:12.625 --> 00:02:18.923
The spirit gasped. "The Tang Monk is very important!"

30
00:02:18.924 --> 00:02:21.250
"Why?" Roxy asked.

31
00:02:21.251 --> 00:02:26.372
"The Tang Monk is traveling to the West," the spirit said.

32
00:02:26.373 --> 00:02:30.817
"He hopes to receive the True Scriptures from Buddha.

33
00:02:30.818 --> 00:02:35.924
The scriptures will help the people in the Tang Empire to be good.

34
00:02:35.925 --> 00:02:40.711
Everyone wants him to succeed."

35
00:02:40.712 --> 00:02:43.414
"Wow!" Roxy said.

36
00:02:43.415 --> 00:02:48.612
"But there's no need to worry," the spirit added with a smile.

37
00:02:48.613 --> 00:02:51.746
"I just remembered something!

38
00:02:51.747 --> 00:02:58.597
The Tang Monk is traveling with a very powerful spirit who can destroy demons.

39
00:02:58.598 --> 00:03:03.816
His name is Sun Wukong, the Monkey King.

40
00:03:03.817 --> 00:03:08.003
He once defeated Heaven's entire army."

41
00:03:08.004 --> 00:03:09.618
Roxy bit her lip.

42
00:03:09.619 --> 00:03:13.903
"I actually met Sun Wukong, and I have some bad news.

43
00:03:13.904 --> 00:03:18.626
He's in another world right now, so he's not here to help the Tang Monk."

44
00:03:18.627 --> 00:03:22.549
"Oh dear." The spirit looked nervous.

45
00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:24.618
Roxy glanced up at the cave.

46
00:03:24.619 --> 00:03:29.106
"I don't have a choice, Spirit—I have to save the Tang Monk."

47
00:03:29.107 --> 00:03:30.982
The spirit looked thoughtful.

48
00:03:30.983 --> 00:03:40.613
"Perhaps we can save him together. I think I have a plan."

49
00:03:40.614 --> 00:03:45.665
"Hello?" Detective Smith was in his office at police headquarters, talking on the phone.

50
00:03:45.666 --> 00:03:50.096
"Tell every police officer in Metro City to search for a pig and monkey.

51
00:03:50.097 --> 00:03:53.652
They're under arrest for breaking out of jail."

52
00:03:53.653 --> 00:03:59.359
"Detective!" Mayor Bloom cried, hurrying into the office.

53
00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:02.854
He was breathing heavily, and his tie was loose.

54
00:04:02.855 --> 00:04:04.968
Detective Smith hung up the phone.

55
00:04:04.969 --> 00:04:08.041
"What's wrong, Mayor? Why are you out of breath?"

56
00:04:08.042 --> 00:04:15.987
"I ran here . . . all the way . . . from City Hall," the mayor said between breaths.

57
00:04:15.988 --> 00:04:24.929
"We have a big problem. An army of monkeys and apes has taken over Metro City!"

